WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.193
In tutorial 8.6, you'll see exactly
what AI assistants say to your buyers,

00:00:11.243 --> 00:00:12.951
and who they name and cite.

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:17.510
First, scroll down AI
visibility to Answers.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:21.110
It shows what each assistant
said to every question in a run.

00:00:22.079 --> 00:00:25.279
Pick an earlier run here, search
the questions and answers,

00:00:25.329 --> 00:00:29.343
or show only the answers that name
you, cite you or leave you out.

00:00:30.583 --> 00:00:33.733
Each card shows the assistant,
whether it named you,

00:00:33.783 --> 00:00:37.117
the question with its buyer role
and market, and what it said.

00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:41.718
Brands, in the order named,
shows who came first.

00:00:41.768 --> 00:00:44.954
In this answer, other businesses
were named, and you weren't.

00:00:46.129 --> 00:00:48.744
Now search for a question,
and choose Cited.

00:00:48.794 --> 00:00:51.107
Here, the assistant named you first.

00:00:53.104 --> 00:00:57.761
Click Show the whole answer, to read
everything the assistant said, word for word.

00:00:59.579 --> 00:01:04.581
Pages cited lists every link in the answer,
and your own pages are marked Yours.

00:01:06.129 --> 00:01:11.279
Next to it, Read but not cited lists the
pages the assistant read but didn't cite,

00:01:11.329 --> 00:01:12.447
yours included.

00:01:13.410 --> 00:01:16.535
Below, you see what the assistant
searched before answering,

00:01:16.585 --> 00:01:18.053
and the sources it used.

00:01:19.906 --> 00:01:25.456
When an answer shows them, you also see
local business cards, product cards and ads.

00:01:25.506 --> 00:01:28.261
This one showed local
cards, with you first.

00:01:29.245 --> 00:01:31.595
Then click Every engine and its history,

00:01:31.645 --> 00:01:35.566
to see every assistant's answer
to that question, side by side.

00:01:36.745 --> 00:01:41.395
So you see exactly what AI tells your
buyers, word for word, who it names,

00:01:41.445 --> 00:01:43.728
and which pages it reads and trusts.

00:01:44.752 --> 00:01:48.917
So, open Answers, read the whole
answer, see the brands in order,

00:01:48.967 --> 00:01:52.863
find the pages cited and read,
and compare every assistant.

00:01:53.903 --> 00:01:56.778
Now you know what AI says about you. Next,

00:01:56.828 --> 00:02:00.861
follow your AI visibility
over time in tutorial 8.7.
